  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Old Oracle is a young-looking wisdom path Gu Immortal from Ancient Soul Sect. He walks to the center of the battlefield, stretches out his fist from his sleeve, and opens his five fingers. A colorless crystal bamboo grows out of his palm. He states that the move uses rank six Immortal Gu Bamboo Gentleman as the core, with six hundred and sixty mortal Gu complementing it. The core is rank six, yet the move can work against rank seven Gu Immortals and not against rank eight. After Qin Bai Sheng answers the first question, the colorless bamboo sways with no change in color, which is treated as proof that the words are truthful.",
      "chapters": [
        768
      ],
