    {
      "text": "An hour later Qin Bai Sheng leaves. Feng Jiu Ge tells the others he found that Qin Bai Sheng has a method to detonate his soul. He then says they can look at this colorless crystal bamboo to tell if he lied. Old Oracle smiles sheepishly and retracts the immortal killer move.",
